{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Filtered.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Homology.HomologicalComplex","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Set.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Bounds.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.HomologicalCondensation"],"declarations":30,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.framework_condensation_of_all_complete","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.framework_condensation_of_all_complete","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L206-L219","doc":"**Bridge corollary.** Given a `BBSpectralSequenceProvider`, the\nframework's `InfinityVanishesAtPositiveQ n` follows from the\nBB-stratification at `n` having all strata complete-intersection.\n\nThis is the structural form of `condensation_at_magic`: instead\nof asserting the predicate axiomatically per-n, we derive it from\nthe BB-stratum complete-intersection property. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.vanishesAt_of_vanishesInPositiveQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.vanishesAt_of_vanishesInPositiveQ","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L196-L204","doc":"The spectral sequence's positive-q vanishing implies, in\nparticular, that the eventual `E_∞^{p, q}` is zero for q > 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.einf_eq_eventually_at","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.einf_eq_eventually_at","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L183-L194","doc":"**Lemma (convergence stability).** Sizes on the `E_∞`-page are\nstable: equal to `E_r` for `r ≥ r₀(p, q)`. Provable from the\n`converges` field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.vanishes_when_all_complete","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.vanishes_when_all_complete","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L171-L181","doc":"**Theorem (collapse from complete-intersection strata).** If\nevery BB-stratum at strand count `n` is a complete intersection,\nthen the spectral sequence at `n` vanishes in positive q. This\nis the abstract form of `condensation_at_magic` once we have a\nBB-spectral-sequence in scope. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider.bridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider.bridge","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L164-L164","doc":"Bridge: the framework's condensation predicate aligns with\nthe spectral sequence's positive-q-vanishing predicate.\n\nFormally: at each `(n, q)`, the spectral sequence built from\nthe BB-stratification vanishes in positive q-degree iff the\nframework predicate `InfinityVanishesAtPositiveQ n` holds.\nConcrete instances supply the equivalence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider.bbSeq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider.bbSeq","kind":"def","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L156-L156","doc":"The BB-spectral sequence at strand count `n` and substrate\nparameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider.mk","kind":"ctor","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L153-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequenceProvider","kind":"class","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L145-L167","doc":"The framework's `InfinityVanishesAtPositiveQ` predicate (from\n`HomologicalCondensation.lean`) is exactly\n`SpectralSequence.vanishesInPositiveQ` for the spectral sequence\nbuilt from the BB-stratification.\n\nThis bridge is exposed as an abstract typeclass: concrete\ninstances supply the BB-spectral-sequence at each strand count\n`n`, and the predicate aligns. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.collapse_when_all_complete","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.collapse_when_all_complete","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L139-L139","doc":"Collapse condition: if every stratum is a complete\nintersection, then `E_∞^{p, q > 0} = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.spectralSequence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.spectralSequence","kind":"def","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L136-L136","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.stratification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.stratification","kind":"def","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L135-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L134-L134","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBSpectralSequence","kind":"structure","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L124-L141","doc":"A **BB spectral sequence** ties a BB-stratification to a\nspectral sequence such that the stratum-collapse condition\n(all strata are complete intersections) implies the spectral\nsequence vanishes in positive q-degree.\n\nThis abstracts the relationship in\n`conj:homological-shell-condensation`: if every BB-stratum\nof the Hecke category at strand count `n` satisfies the\ncomplete-intersection property, then no obstruction classes\nsurvive in higher cohomology. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.vanishesInPositiveQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.vanishesInPositiveQ","kind":"def","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L118-L120","doc":"\"Vanishes in positive q\": `E_∞^{p, q} = 0` for all `q > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.vanishesAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.vanishesAt","kind":"def","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L114-L116","doc":"`E_∞^{p, q} = 0` iff the eventual stable size at `(p, q)` is zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.einf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.einf","kind":"def","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L109-L112","doc":"The `E_∞` page of a spectral sequence (the eventual stable size). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.size_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.size_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L107-L107","doc":"Sizes are non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.converges","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.converges","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L105-L105","doc":"Convergence: there exists `r₀` such that for all `r ≥ r₀`,\n`size r p q = size r₀ p q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.size","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.size","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L102-L102","doc":"Size at page `r`, position `(p, q)`, of the cohomology. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L100-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.SpectralSequence","kind":"structure","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L91-L107","doc":"An **abstract bigraded spectral sequence** with pages\n`E_r^{p, q}` for `r ≥ 2`. We track only the structural facts\nneeded for the framework:\n- Pages indexed by `(r, p, q) ∈ ℕ × ℕ × ℕ`.\n- Each page has a real-valued \"size\" (= dimension or norm of\n  the cohomology class at that bidegree).\n- Differentials `d_r : E_r^{p, q} → E_r^{p + r, q - r + 1}` —\n  we expose them via the resulting page-(r+1) sizes.\n- A convergence target `E_∞^{p, q}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.completeIntersectionStrata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.completeIntersectionStrata","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L84-L87","doc":"The set of complete-intersection strata in a BB-stratification. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.refines_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.refines_trans","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Refinement is transitive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.refines_refl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.refines_refl","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Refinement is reflexive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.is_complete_intersection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.is_complete_intersection","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L78-L78","doc":"Predicate: stratum λ has the complete-intersection property\n(= no obstruction to lifting the section across higher jets). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.refines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.refines","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Partial order on strata. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.length","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L73-L73","doc":"The length of the filtration. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.Index","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.Index","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Indexing poset of the filtration (partitions of n, or a\nposet abstraction thereof). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification.mk","kind":"ctor","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.BBStratification.BBStratification","kind":"structure","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/LiftingDescent/BBStratification.lean#L55-L82","doc":"A **Białynicki–Birula stratification** at strand count `n`:\nabstractly, a finite filtration of the Hecke category\nindexed by partitions `λ ⊢ n` (or some other poset), with\neach stratum `X_λ` a locally closed subvariety carrying its\nHoefsmit cell.\n\nFor our framework we expose only the structural data:\n- `Index`: the indexing poset (typically partitions of n).\n- `length`: the length of the filtration (≤ #partitions of n).\n- `refines`: the partial order on strata.\n- `is_complete_intersection`: predicate identifying strata that\n  satisfy the complete-intersection property — these are the\n  \"magic\" strata where obstruction classes vanish. ","signatureChunk":0}]}